  "rule": "A sweep category retires from the loop when every surface below has been reviewed in that category during the current loop AND the most recent pass over all of them found nothing. A review goes stale after 8 weeks or 20 releases, whichever comes first; a stale surface counts as unreviewed. This replaces \"three consecutive empty sweeps\" for usability, visual and quality of life, which never run out of findings: three empty sweeps there would mean the sweeper stopped looking, not that there was nothing left (M52.8).",
